<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 24/25.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 24/25.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>25-28. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  April 25-28    April 24/25</p>
<p> CZK	0.44916	0.45084</p>
<p> DKK	2.10035	2.10015</p>
<p> FIM	2.65949	2.66225</p>
<p> HUF	0.07589	0.07593</p>
<p> JPY	0.10894	0.109</p>
<p> LTL	3.43189	3.4369</p>
<p> LVL     23.60052     23.61928</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.78386	1.79453</p>
<p> UAH	7.46073	7.46037</p>
<p> USD     13.7296	13.7476</p>
<p> XEU     15.57623     15.59596</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
